{
  "version": "0.6.3",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-22T09:55:00+03:00",
  "notes": [
    "Removes manual Minion Calculator upgrade selectors and automatically evaluates compatible zero-, one- and two-slot upgrade setups for highest net profit.",
    "Adds an upgrade comparison table to each minion detail view so alternative setups and their profitability can be inspected.",
    "Adds compatibility-aware minion-specific upgrades. Gravel Minion now produces Gravel by default; Flint Shovel is modeled as a Gravel-only upgrade that converts output to Flint.",
    "Preserves one-time setup cost separately from daily profit; automatic upgrade choice is based on recurring net profit."
  ],
